{
 "id": "shardmother",
 "name": "Shardmother",
 "role": "Splinterborn boss \u00b7 Apex Splinter Lures, later realm splinter rooms \u00b7 Call Adds, Shield Phase, Splinter Volley",
 "hitbox_blocks": [
  4.0,
  2.0,
  4.0
 ],
 "notes": [
  "Facing north (-Z). Origin at feet centre. 1 grid square = 1 texture pixel = 1/16 block. Hitbox 4 x 2 x 4 blocks around the body; the six legs, pincers and the splinter reach past it.",
  "A crab-spider broodmother: glossy crystal-crusted chitin, two big pincers with crystal tips, six jointed legs, a cluster of six glowing eyes, and glowing egg sacs of splinter light on her sides and rear. The splinter rises from the middle of her back among amethyst-like crystals.",
  "Bones (23): root > body > head > arm_l > claw_l, arm_r > claw_r; body > abdomen > splinter, sacs, crystals; body > leg_l1..3 > leg_l1..3_lower (same on the right).",
  "Animations: spawn (crawls up over the island edge), idle (sacs pulse, pincers click), walk (spider gait), attack (pincer snap), hurt, death (legs curl in, sacs burst into light, the splinter drops), ability_call_adds (sacs split, Splinter Mites pour out), ability_shield_phase (loop: tucks legs, crystals flare, Splinter Wisps orbit), ability_splinter_volley (rears up, back crystals fire)."
 ],
